OL,3,GNEWSAMan who broke ribs of 25-day-old
OL,4,Ababy jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who broke a 25-day-old baby's
OL,7,Fribs has been jailed for
OL,8,Ffive-and-a-half years.
OL,10,FJoshua Grant, 32, from Reading,
OL,11,Fadmitted breaking two of the baby's
OL,12,Fribs and causing them brain, spinal and
OL,13,Fretinal haemorrhaging in March 2023.
OL,15,FHe also punched a security guard in the
OL,16,Fface at the Tesco Express in Bath Road,
OL,17,FReading, in January this year. Grant
OL,18,Fleft the man with lasting injuries to
OL,19,Fhis teeth, before he fled with stolen
OL,20,Fgoods.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
